      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>I&#39;ve been trying to play some games in the Temple of Zhu Long, and I&#39;m curious as to how Rites of Renewal works. &nbsp;Is it:</p><p>(a) &nbsp;If the heroes discard X cards in a *single* round, they can resurrect a fallen hero at the end of the environment turn; OR</p><p>(b) The heroes discard any number of cards they want every turn; once the total number of cards discarded over the course of the game reaches X, they can resurrect a fallen comrade at the end of the next environment turn.</p><p>I didn&#39;t want to go about discarding cards until I was sure how it worked.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
