      "created_at": "2016-11-30T16:06:51.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>You still have a deck of cards they just aren't in play anymore. &nbsp;Regardless, it would make Rites of Revival pretty worthless if you can't get the hero deck back into play. &nbsp;Maybe it should have been worded differently but we know that the deck comes back per the video game. &nbsp; In regards to Requital Capitan Cosmic I'd say the deck under his incap card would get shuffled with this other cards along with any in play due to those abilities. &nbsp;</p>",
