      "created_at": "2016-11-30T17:04:43.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>From the last sentence of the very last paragraph of the latest fireside chats:</p><p>\"<span>Suppose Sky-Scraper is incapacitated and has used the “become a target” incapacitated ability. If she is revived using Rites of Revival, the 1 HP indestructible target status is wiped, and she is her regular self at 8 HP with a 33 HP max and is fully destructible. Rites of Revival essentially resets the character, starting anew.\"</span></p><p>To me that means everything that the entire deck is restored as if the character was starting over. Full 40 cards regardless of where they may have been right before Revival activated.&nbsp;</p>",
